---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ToolAccessGate from '../components/ToolAccessGate.astro';
const schema = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@graph':[
  {'@type':'WebApplication',name:'BarcodeNest Barcode Validator',url:'https://barcodenest.com/barcode-validator/',applicationCategory:'DeveloperApplication',operatingSystem:'Any',isAccessibleForFree:true,description:'Check the length and check digit of EAN-8, UPC-A, EAN-13 and GTIN-14 barcode numbers in your browser.'},
  {'@type':'BreadcrumbList',itemListElement:[{'@type':'ListItem',position:1,name:'Home',item:'https://barcodenest.com/'},{'@type':'ListItem',position:2,name:'Barcode validator',item:'https://barcodenest.com/barcode-validator/'}]}
]};
---
<BaseLayout title="Free Barcode Validator | Check UPC, EAN & GTIN | BarcodeNest" description="Validate UPC, EAN and GTIN barcodes for free. Check barcode length and check digit, preserve leading zeros, and see the canonical GTIN-14. Free account required." structuredData={schema}>
  <section class="validator-hero"><div class="container">
    <nav class="validator-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Barcode validator</span></nav>
    <div class="eyebrow">Free barcode tool</div><h1>Free online barcode validator</h1><p class="lede">Paste a barcode number into BarcodeNest to check its length and check digit. It supports UPC-A, EAN-8, EAN-13, and GTIN-14 and shows the 14-digit GTIN used for matching.</p>
    <ToolAccessGate inline />
    <div class="validator-panel">
      <form id="barcode-validator" novalidate><fieldset data-account-tool disabled style="border:0;margin:0;padding:0;min-width:0">
        <label for="barcode-input">Barcode number</label>
        <p id="barcode-hint" class="validator-hint">Enter 8, 12, 13 or 14 digits, including the final check digit. Keep any leading zeros.</p>
        <div class="validator-controls"><input id="barcode-input" name="barcode" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="64" aria-describedby="barcode-hint" placeholder="e.g. 3017620422003" /><button class="button button-signal" type="submit">Validate barcode</button></div>
      </fieldset></form>
      <p class="validator-examples">Try an example: <button type="button" data-tool-button disabled data-barcode="3017620422003">EAN-13</button><button type="button" data-tool-button disabled data-barcode="012345678905">UPC-A</button><button type="button" data-tool-button disabled data-barcode="3017620422004">Incorrect check digit</button></p>
      <noscript><p>This interactive tool needs JavaScript. You can still read the validation method below.</p></noscript>
      <section id="validation-result" class="validator-result" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" tabindex="-1" hidden><h2 id="result-title"></h2><p id="result-message"></p><dl id="result-details"></dl></section>
      <p class="validator-hint validator-privacy">Free with an account. The identifier is sent to BarcodeNest for validation. Sign in to check a barcode.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container validator-columns">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">What the result means</div><h2>A valid check digit is the first step.</h2><p>The tool checks whether a number has a supported length and follows the GTIN check-digit calculation. It also shows the canonical 14-digit representation, with leading zeros preserved.</p><p>A passing result does not prove that a number has been assigned by GS1, that a product is genuine, or that a product record exists in a database.</p><p>If you are checking a physical item, see <a href="/blog/can-a-barcode-prove-a-product-is-real/">what a barcode can tell you about product authenticity</a>.</p><p>To retrieve a product name, brand or other available details, use the <a href="/docs/barcode-lookup/">barcode lookup API</a> or explore the <a href="/products/">product directory</a>.</p></div>
    <div class="validator-reference"><h2>Supported formats</h2><table><caption class="sr-only">Supported barcode types and lengths, including the check digit</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Format</th><th scope="col">Total digits</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">EAN-8 / GTIN-8</th><td>8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">UPC-A / GTIN-12</th><td>12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">EAN-13 / GTIN-13</th><td>13</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">GTIN-14</th><td>14</td></tr></tbody></table><p>UPC-E, ISBN-10, QR codes and alphanumeric barcode formats are outside this tool’s scope. An eight-digit number is evaluated as EAN-8, not expanded from UPC-E.</p></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">The calculation</div><h2>How a barcode check digit works</h2><ol class="validator-steps"><li>Set aside the last digit of the barcode.</li><li>Starting with the rightmost remaining digit, multiply digits alternately by 3 and 1.</li><li>Add the weighted values together.</li><li>The check digit is the amount needed to reach the next multiple of 10. If the sum is already a multiple of 10, the check digit is 0.</li></ol><p>For <code>3017620422003</code>, the body <code>301762042200</code> has a weighted sum of 57. Adding 3 gives 60, so its check digit is 3.</p><p>Try <code>3017620422003</code> for a valid EAN-13. If you enter <code>3017620422004</code>, the validator reports that the expected final digit is 3. A mismatch can indicate a transcription error anywhere in the number. Compare the full barcode with the packaging rather than automatically replacing its final digit.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><h2>Common barcode questions</h2><p>For implementation examples, read <a href="/blog/barcode-check-digit-javascript/">JavaScript check-digit validation</a> and <a href="/blog/keep-leading-zeros-barcodes-excel/">keeping barcode leading zeros in Excel</a>.</p><h3>Why keep leading zeros?</h3><p>Barcodes are identifiers, not quantities. Store them as text. Converting a barcode to a number can remove leading zeros and change its length.</p><h3>Why is a valid barcode not found?</h3><p>Validation and product lookup answer different questions. A barcode can pass its checksum while being absent from a particular catalog. <a href="/docs/errors/">Read the API error reference</a> to handle unsuccessful lookups.</p><h3>Can this check a barcode image?</h3><p>Use the <a href="/barcode-scanner/">barcode scanner</a> to decode an uploaded image or camera capture. This validator checks the digits you enter.</p><h3>Can I use validation in an integration?</h3><p>The BarcodeNest API validates supported identifiers before lookup and returns their canonical GTIN. See the <a href="/docs/barcode-lookup/">lookup documentation</a> and <a href="/docs/rate-limits/">usage limits</a>.</p><a class="button button-signal" href="/register/">Try the product lookup API</a></div></section>
<p><a href="/barcode-generator/">Generate an SVG or PNG barcode</a> after validating the identifier.</p></BaseLayout>
<script>
  import { authFetch, responseMessage } from '../scripts/auth-context';
  const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#barcode-validator')!;
  const input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#barcode-input')!;
  const result=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#validation-result')!;
  const title=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result-title')!;
  const message=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result-message')!;
  const details=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result-details')!;
  function addDetail(label:string,value:string) { const row=document.createElement('div'); const dt=document.createElement('dt'); const dd=document.createElement('dd'); dt.textContent=label;dd.textContent=value;row.append(dt,dd);details.append(row); }
  form.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{
    event.preventDefault();
    const button = form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;
    if (button.disabled) return;
    button.disabled = true;
    try {
    const response = await authFetch("/account/barcodes/validate", {
      method: "POST", headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
      body: JSON.stringify({ value: input.value }),
    });
    if (!response.ok) throw new Error(await responseMessage(response));
    const checked = await response.json();
    details.replaceChildren(); result.hidden=false;
    input.setAttribute('aria-invalid',String(!checked.valid)); result.dataset.valid=String(checked.valid);
    title.textContent=checked.valid?'Valid format and check digit':'Barcode needs attention';
    message.textContent=checked.valid?'The length and check digit pass. This does not confirm GS1 assignment or product availability.':checked.error;
    if(checked.format) addDetail('Detected format',checked.format);
    if(checked.valid) { addDetail('Barcode',checked.value);addDetail('Check digit',checked.expected);addDetail('Canonical GTIN-14',checked.gtin14);addDetail('Equivalent representations',checked.equivalents.join(', ')); }
    result.focus({preventScroll:true});
    } catch (error) {
      result.hidden = false;
      title.textContent = "Validation unavailable";
      message.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "Please sign in and try again.";
      details.replaceChildren();
    } finally { button.disabled = false; }
  });
  input.addEventListener('input',()=>{result.hidden=true;input.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');});
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-barcode]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{input.value=button.dataset.barcode!;form.requestSubmit();}));
</script>
<style>
  .validator-hero{padding:48px 0 64px}.validator-hero h1{max-width:850px}.validator-hero .lede{max-width:760px}.validator-crumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:30px;font-size:14px}.validator-crumb a,.section a:not(.button){text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.validator-panel{max-width:900px;margin-top:36px;padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--paper-2)}label{font-weight:600;font-size:18px}.validator-hint{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 16px}.validator-controls{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}.validator-controls input{flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--muted);border-radius:5px;padding:16px;font:20px 'Geist Mono',monospace;color:var(--ink)}.validator-controls input[aria-invalid=true]{border:2px solid var(--ink)}.validator-controls .button{min-height:56px;white-space:nowrap}.validator-examples{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:18px 0;font-size:14px}.validator-examples button{min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.validator-result{margin-top:24px;padding:24px;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:6px;background:var(--paper)}.validator-result[data-valid=true]{border-color:var(--signal-dark)}.validator-result h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:12px}.validator-result dl{margin:0}.validator-result :global(dl>div){display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.validator-result :global(dt){color:var(--muted)}.validator-result :global(dd){margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace}.validator-privacy{margin:20px 0 0}.validator-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:64px}.validator-reference{padding:28px;background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:var(--radius)}.validator-reference h2{font-size:28px}.validator-reference table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px}.validator-reference th,.validator-reference td{text-align:left;padding:12px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.validator-reference p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.validator-steps{padding-left:24px}.validator-steps li{padding-bottom:12px}input:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,.validator-result:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:4px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  @media(max-width:800px){.validator-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.validator-panel{padding:24px}}
  @media(max-width:540px){.validator-hero{padding-top:28px}.validator-hero h1{font-size:44px}.validator-panel{padding:20px}.validator-controls{flex-direction:column}.validator-result{padding:18px}.validator-result :global(dl>div){grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}}
</style>
